{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233190","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233190","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1423319001:1":{"text":"是你们啊，真看不出来你们这么厉害。我还以为你们跟看起来一样柔弱呢。","source_cn":"是你们啊，真看不出来你们这么厉害。我还以为你们跟看起来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BC833FFE7FF62C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423319002:1":{"text":"这次要捕猎的幻灵孢菇十分凶猛，如果不是有你们，可能真要出事了。","source_cn":"这次要捕猎的幻灵孢菇十分凶猛，如果不是有你们，可能真要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x236E55CDB9D89135","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423319003:1":{"text":"我在书里读到过，幻灵孢菇会用孢子攻击人类，还会制造欺骗人类的幻影，果然如书上所言。","source_cn":"我在书里读到过，幻灵孢菇会用孢子攻击人类，还会制造欺骗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41DBA3621BC56927","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423319004:1":{"text":"但是人们会狩猎它作为食物，这我还是第一次知道。","source_cn":"但是人们会狩猎它作为食物，这我还是第一次知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C4CCB26CED4C617","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423319005:1":{"text":"毕竟平民区没有那么多可以吃的东西嘛。","source_cn":"毕竟平民区没有那么多可以吃的东西嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B4FA08D82041A44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423319006:1":{"text":"我们没有帮你抓到它……你是不是要饿肚子了？","source_cn":"我们没有帮你抓到它……你是不是要饿肚子了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEFDFD86150B7955","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423319007:1":{"text":"没那么糟糕，狩猎失败是常有的事。我想想，要不钓条鱼来填填肚子吧？你们要一起吗？","source_cn":"没那么糟糕，狩猎失败是常有的事。我想想，要不钓条鱼来填...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x128E50FDCA2DB24E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423319008:1":{"text":"钓鱼吗？可是我从来没有钓过鱼，我吃的鱼都是从市集买来的……","source_cn":"钓鱼吗？可是我从来没有钓过鱼，我吃的鱼都是从市集买来的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CCCCEE037B44520","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423319009:1":{"text":"那些鱼都是平民钓起来送到城里的啦。原来你连钓鱼都不会，真是缺乏生存技能……","source_cn":"那些鱼都是平民钓起来送到城里的啦。原来你连钓鱼都不会，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57B8F3C2D449DCFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423319010:1":{"text":"我也这么觉得……","source_cn":"我也这么觉得……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD056F91E748C54C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1423319010":{"text